sequenceDiagram
    %% ShiftManager Request Approval Workflow
    %% Shows Time-Off and Swap Request flows from creation to approval/decline

    participant Employee as 👤 Employee
    participant CreatePage as 📄 /Requests/Create
    participant DB as 💿 SQLite Database
    participant ManagerPage as 👔 /Requests/Index (Manager)
    participant ConflictChecker as ⚙️ ConflictChecker
    participant NotificationService as 🔔 NotificationService
    participant EmailService as 📧 EmailService

    %% ========================================
    %% TIME-OFF REQUEST WORKFLOW
    %% ========================================

    Note over Employee,EmailService: 🏖️ Time-Off Request Workflow

    Employee->>CreatePage: Navigate to /Requests/Create
    CreatePage-->>Employee: Show request form (type selection)

    Employee->>CreatePage: Submit Time-Off Request<br/>{<br/>  StartDate: "2025-06-15",<br/>  EndDate: "2025-06-20",<br/>  Reason: "Family vacation",<br/>  Type: TimeOff<br/>}

    CreatePage->>CreatePage: Validate input:<br/>• StartDate <= EndDate<br/>• Dates not in past<br/>• Reason max 500 chars

    alt Validation fails
        CreatePage-->>Employee: Error: "End date must be after start"
    end

    CreatePage->>DB: INSERT INTO TimeOffRequests:<br/>UserId = current user,<br/>CompanyId = current company,<br/>StartDate, EndDate, Reason,<br/>Status = Pending,<br/>CreatedAt = NOW
    DB-->>CreatePage: TimeOffRequest created (ID=42)

    CreatePage->>NotificationService: CreateNotification(<br/>  Type: TimeOffRequested,<br/>  TargetUserId: managerId,<br/>  Message: "John Doe requested time off"<br/>)
    NotificationService->>DB: INSERT INTO Notifications
    NotificationService->>EmailService: SendEmailAsync(manager.Email)

    CreatePage-->>Employee: Success: "Request submitted"<br/>Redirect to /Requests/Mine

    %% ========================================
    %% MANAGER APPROVAL (TIME-OFF)
    %% ========================================

    Note over Employee,EmailService: 👔 Manager Reviews Time-Off Request

    ManagerPage->>DB: Query TimeOffRequests<br/>WHERE CompanyId IN (user's companies)<br/>AND Status = Pending<br/>ORDER BY CreatedAt DESC

    Note over ManagerPage: Multi-company access:<br/>• Owner: All companies<br/>• Director: All companies<br/>• Manager: Own company only

    DB-->>ManagerPage: List of pending requests
    ManagerPage-->>ManagerPage: Display requests (21 from Company A, 5 from Company B)

    ManagerPage->>ManagerPage: Manager clicks "Approve" (RequestId=42)

    ManagerPage->>DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION

    ManagerPage->>DB: UPDATE TimeOffRequests<br/>SET Status = Approved,<br/>    ApprovedBy = managerId,<br/>    ApprovedAt = NOW<br/>WHERE Id = 42

    ManagerPage->>DB: DELETE FROM ShiftAssignments<br/>WHERE UserId = 42's employee<br/>AND WorkDate BETWEEN '2025-06-15' AND '2025-06-20'

    Note over ManagerPage,DB: Auto-delete overlapping shifts<br/>(6 shifts deleted for 6-day vacation)

    ManagerPage->>DB: COMMIT TRANSACTION

    ManagerPage->>NotificationService: CreateNotification(<br/>  Type: TimeOffApproved,<br/>  TargetUserId: employeeId,<br/>  Message: "Your time-off was approved"<br/>)
    NotificationService->>DB: INSERT INTO Notifications
    NotificationService->>EmailService: SendEmailAsync(employee.Email)

    ManagerPage-->>ManagerPage: Success: "Request approved"

    %% ========================================
    %% SWAP REQUEST WORKFLOW
    %% ========================================

    Note over Employee,EmailService: 🔄 Shift Swap Request Workflow

    Employee->>CreatePage: Submit Swap Request<br/>{<br/>  ShiftAssignmentId: 123,<br/>  TargetUserId: 456,<br/>  Reason: "Need to switch schedules",<br/>  Type: SwapShift<br/>}

    CreatePage->>DB: Query ShiftAssignment (ID=123)
    DB-->>CreatePage: ShiftAssignment (CurrentUserId=Employee, WorkDate=2025-07-10)

    alt Shift not found or unauthorized
        CreatePage-->>Employee: Error: "Invalid shift"
    end

    CreatePage->>ConflictChecker: CanAssignAsync(<br/>  userId: 456,<br/>  shiftInstance: {WorkDate, StartTime, EndTime}<br/>)

    Note over ConflictChecker: Pre-validation checks:<br/>1. Check approved time-off<br/>2. Check overlapping shifts<br/>3. Check rest period (8h default)<br/>4. Check weekly hours cap (40h)

    ConflictChecker->>DB: Query TimeOffRequests, ShiftAssignments, AppConfig
    DB-->>ConflictChecker: Data for validation
    ConflictChecker-->>CreatePage: ConflictResult (HasConflict: false)

    alt Conflict detected
        CreatePage-->>Employee: Error: "Target user has time-off that day"
    end

    CreatePage->>DB: INSERT INTO SwapRequests:<br/>UserId = current employee,<br/>CompanyId = current company,<br/>ShiftAssignmentId = 123,<br/>TargetUserId = 456,<br/>Status = Pending,<br/>CreatedAt = NOW
    DB-->>CreatePage: SwapRequest created (ID=99)

    CreatePage->>NotificationService: CreateNotification(<br/>  Type: SwapRequested,<br/>  TargetUserId: managerId,<br/>  Message: "John Doe requested swap with Jane Smith"<br/>)
    NotificationService->>DB: INSERT INTO Notifications
    NotificationService->>EmailService: SendEmailAsync(manager.Email)

    CreatePage-->>Employee: Success: "Swap request submitted"

    %% ========================================
    %% MANAGER APPROVAL (SWAP)
    %% ========================================

    Note over Employee,EmailService: 👔 Manager Reviews Swap Request

    ManagerPage->>DB: Query SwapRequests<br/>WHERE CompanyId IN (user's companies)<br/>AND Status = Pending<br/>INCLUDE ShiftAssignment, CurrentUser, TargetUser

    DB-->>ManagerPage: List of pending swap requests
    ManagerPage-->>ManagerPage: Display: "John → Jane (Shift: July 10 Morning)"

    ManagerPage->>ManagerPage: Manager clicks "Approve" (SwapId=99)

    ManagerPage->>ConflictChecker: CanAssignAsync(<br/>  userId: 456,<br/>  shiftInstance: {WorkDate, StartTime, EndTime}<br/>)

    Note over ConflictChecker: Re-validate before approval<br/>(conditions may have changed)

    ConflictChecker->>DB: Query latest data
    DB-->>ConflictChecker: Data for validation
    ConflictChecker-->>ManagerPage: ConflictResult (HasConflict: false)

    alt Conflict detected (changed since request creation)
        ManagerPage-->>ManagerPage: Error: "Conflict detected.<br/>Target user now has time-off."
    end

    ManagerPage->>DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION

    ManagerPage->>DB: UPDATE SwapRequests<br/>SET Status = Approved,<br/>    ApprovedBy = managerId,<br/>    ApprovedAt = NOW<br/>WHERE Id = 99

    ManagerPage->>DB: UPDATE ShiftAssignments<br/>SET UserId = 456 (TargetUser),<br/>    UpdatedAt = NOW<br/>WHERE Id = 123

    Note over ManagerPage,DB: Atomic swap: Shift ownership transferred<br/>from John (CurrentUser) to Jane (TargetUser)

    ManagerPage->>DB: COMMIT TRANSACTION

    ManagerPage->>NotificationService: CreateNotification (x2):<br/>1. Type: SwapApproved → John<br/>2. Type: ShiftAdded → Jane
    NotificationService->>DB: INSERT INTO Notifications (2 rows)
    NotificationService->>EmailService: SendEmailAsync (2 emails)

    ManagerPage-->>ManagerPage: Success: "Swap approved"

    %% ========================================
    %% DECLINE FLOW (BOTH TYPES)
    %% ========================================

    Note over Employee,EmailService: ❌ Decline Workflow (Time-Off or Swap)

    ManagerPage->>ManagerPage: Manager clicks "Decline" (RequestId=42)

    ManagerPage->>DB: UPDATE TimeOffRequests/SwapRequests<br/>SET Status = Declined,<br/>    ApprovedBy = managerId,<br/>    ApprovedAt = NOW<br/>WHERE Id = 42

    Note over ManagerPage,DB: No shift deletions or swaps occur<br/>(Request simply marked as Declined)

    ManagerPage->>NotificationService: CreateNotification(<br/>  Type: TimeOffDeclined / SwapDeclined,<br/>  TargetUserId: employeeId,<br/>  Message: "Your request was declined"<br/>)
    NotificationService->>DB: INSERT INTO Notifications
    NotificationService->>EmailService: SendEmailAsync(employee.Email)

    ManagerPage-->>ManagerPage: Success: "Request declined"

    %% ========================================
    %% AUTHORIZATION SUMMARY
    %% ========================================

    Note over Employee,EmailService: 🔐 AUTHORIZATION RULES:<br/>✓ Create Request: Employee, Assigner, Manager (own company)<br/>✓ View All Requests: Owner/Director (all companies), Manager (own company)<br/>✓ Approve/Decline: Owner/Director/Manager only<br/>✓ Auto-delete shifts: Time-off approval only (not swaps)<br/>✓ Conflict re-check: Always before swap approval<br/>✓ Multi-company: Owner/Director see 21 + 5 requests across companies

    %% ========================================
    %% NOTIFICATION TYPES
    %% ========================================

    Note over NotificationService,EmailService: 📬 NOTIFICATION TYPES:<br/>1. TimeOffRequested → Manager<br/>2. TimeOffApproved → Employee<br/>3. TimeOffDeclined → Employee<br/>4. SwapRequested → Manager<br/>5. SwapApproved → Both employees<br/>6. SwapDeclined → Employee<br/>7. ShiftAdded → Target user (swap approval)
